# Cursor rules for the Payments API (java-sec-code)

You are helping engineers on the Payments API team.

- Use Java 8 and Spring Boot conventions already in this repo.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes; explain any dependency upgrade.
- When touching logging, never log raw request parameters.
- Use the payments-db MCP server only for read-only queries.
- Run the Cycode PR checks before asking for review.
